{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_08_end","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":17,"storyDependence":"act45side_level_act45side_08_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-8","storyName":"童话的开场","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"一场酣畅淋漓的演奏后，Ave{@nbs}Mujica的大家终于回到了梦城堡。闹剧终将收场，Ave{@nbs}Mujica会作为Ave{@nbs}Mujica继续存在着。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_08_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_08","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":15,"characters":["？？？","丰川祥子","三角初华","八幡海铃","祐天寺若麦","若叶睦","卡尔顿们","莫菲丝","沃尔夫","爱丽丝","好心的老妇人","戴着帽子的少女","和善的镇民","卖花的妇人","贝娜","莽撞的卡尔顿们"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":7},{"type":"skipnode","mode":"nofirstskip","id":8},{"type":"interlude","channel":"2","clear":"true","id":9},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":11},{"type":"dialog","id":12},{"type":"character","id":13},{"type":"theater","mode":"true","id":14},{"type":"video","res":"video/act45side/SS01.mp4","id":15},{"type":"dialog","id":16},{"type":"theater","mode":"false","id":17},{"type":"skipnode","mode":"skip","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":19},{"type":"charslot","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":21},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":22},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":23},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_65_i12.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":24},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":25},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avemujica/m_sys3_avemujica_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":26,"musicid":0},{"type":"text","text":"最后一个音符落定，祥子的手仍停留在键盘上。","id":27},{"type":"text","text":"空荡荡的城堡里，还萦绕着方才音乐的微弱回响。","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......小，祥......？","id":29},{"type":"text","text":"许久未闻，却又再熟悉不过的声音在她的身旁响起。她缓缓抬起了头。","id":30},{"type":"dialog","id":31},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"真的......终于......","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"......终于见面了呢，小祥。","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"感觉好像做了一个很长很长的梦，差点醒不过来。","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"小祥，我们真的兜兜转转了好久，差点又要错过了。","id":36},{"type":"text","text":"而站在祥子面前的，除了初华，还有其他的乐队成员。","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"就好像被人拉了一把，然后就出现在了这里。","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"哎呀~干嘛突然这么认真啦？","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"祥，你现在笑得很开心。","id":40},{"type":"text","text":"头顶的聚光灯闪烁着，晃得祥子有些睁不开眼，也让眼前的一切都显得那么不真实，就像又一场梦一样。","id":41},{"type":"text","text":"可她知道，她知道的——","id":42},{"type":"text","text":"她们再一次合奏了属于她们的歌。","id":43},{"type":"text","text":"Ave{@nbs}Mujica的大家，终于回来了。","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"嗯！当然，我现在很开心......","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"初华......睦。","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"若麦......海铃。","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我真的......很想你们。","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"各位——欢迎回来。","id":49},{"type":"dialog","id":50},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":52},{"type":"charslot","id":53},{"type":"image","id":54},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_bg_65_g2_dreamcastlehall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":56},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1937_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_yingying_ked_2","volume":"1","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡尔顿们","text":"（挣扎的哼唧声）","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_npc_1937_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":62},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magicchange","volume":"1","id":63},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.8","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.8","block":"false","id":66},{"type":"charslot","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#13$1","focus":"all","duration":"1","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#7$1","focus":"all","duration":"1","id":69},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":70},{"type":"charslot","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#4$2","focus":"all","duration":"1","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#1$1","focus":"all","duration":"1","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":74},{"type":"charslot","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":76},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"就是这些家伙让我们昏睡的吧？","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#5$1","focus":"m","duration":"2","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"梦境，没有用了......","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"不......不行......","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你们不能离开......你们必须......留在这里！","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1937_1#2$1","focus":"all","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡尔顿们","text":"（尖锐的嘶鸣声）","id":90},{"type":"charslot","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"——大家小心！","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":94},{"type":"charslot","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#3$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"沃尔夫！！","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃尔夫","text":"莫菲丝，别再错下去了！","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_1938_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"别拿你刚从书里学来的话教训我！","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃尔夫","text":"祥子，你带着她们——呃！","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_1938_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":106},{"type":"charslot","id":107},{"type":"text","text":"沃尔夫话音未落，密密麻麻的丝线瞬间刺穿了它的双臂，一缕缕棉花从孔洞中涌了出来。","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"啊！快看天上——","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"charslot","id":112},{"type":"text","text":"不计其数的卡尔顿在头顶的天空中纷飞，织出一张巨大的梦网。","id":113},{"type":"text","text":"梦网一点点朝少女们逼近，而且越来越大。","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃尔夫","text":"莫菲丝......别再执迷不悟了！","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_1938_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":117},{"type":"charslot","id":118},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":119},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":"0.5","block":"true","id":120},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.02","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.25","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"8","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"text","text":"一把巨大的剪刀从空中落下，梦网瞬间被剪碎成了一根根飘摇的丝线，散落在空中，纷纷扬扬。","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1937_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_yingying_ked_2","volume":"1","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡尔顿们","text":"（慌乱的嘶鸣声）","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_npc_1937_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"是谁？！","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":130},{"type":"charslot","id":131},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_5","id":132},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"唔——！","id":138},{"type":"text","text":"少女在空中抽搐了两下，紧接着从高空落下，速度越来越快——","id":139},{"type":"dialog","id":140},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"300,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":142},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":143},{"type":"charslot","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#1$1","posfrom":"-300,0","posto":"150,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","focus":"all","duration":"1","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#5$1","posfrom":"0,300","posto":"0,30","afrom":"0","ato":"1","focus":"all","duration":"0.5","id":147},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"8","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","block":"true","id":148},{"type":"playsound","key":"$punch_n1","id":149},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"1","id":150},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":152},{"type":"charslot","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我、我们得救了？","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"这到底是怎么回事......","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":158},{"type":"charslot","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_338_iris_1#8$1","focus":"all","duration":"1","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_369_bena_1#11$1","focus":"all","duration":"1","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":162},{"type":"charslot","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"抱歉，我们来晚了。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"爱、爱丽丝小姐......！幸亏有你的帮助，谢谢。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":168},{"type":"dialog","id":169},{"type":"text","text":"见到熟悉的仙女，松了一口气的同时，一股无法抗拒的倦意袭来，祥子感到自己的身体不受控制，整个人径直地往地上砸去。","id":170},{"type":"text","text":"沉闷的声音响彻整个大厅。","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"小祥——！","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":176},{"type":"charslot","id":177},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_bg_27_g11_lentinobleroom_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":178},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":179},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":180,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"祥子......祥子......","id":181},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":183},{"type":"charslot","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"（是谁......这次又是谁......）","id":185},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":188},{"type":"text","text":"五感一点点地恢复，祥子隐约闻到了一股淡淡的香味。","id":189},{"type":"text","text":"缓缓睁开眼，她发觉自己正躺在柔软的丝绒沙发上，而身旁坐着一位棕发的少女。","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"啊，你醒啦？","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"你穿梭了太多次梦境，身体实在无法承受负荷，所以才晕倒了。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"不过作为完全没有接触过这类源石技艺的人，你能坚持那么久已经非常让人意外了。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那其他人......","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"不用担心，我已经为她们安排好了房间，贝娜正在陪着她们。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"哦，我好像还没有正式向你介绍自己——我叫爱丽丝，是梦城堡的现任主人。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我们在梦里已经见过了许多次......如果这是我们的第一次相见，那之前的你又是谁？","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"你已经见过了莫菲丝的能力——梦城堡的仙女中有一群特别的人，拥有罕见的造梦源石技艺。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"但这种能力并非无所不能，施术者创造的梦境始终受限于她对被施术者的认知。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"莫菲丝一开始并不了解你，也并没有将你视为势均力敌的对手，所以才会创造出那个有瑕疵的梦。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"至于你为什么会见到我，我想，应该是外婆的功劳吧。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"外婆？","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"嗯，外婆是梦城堡的上一任主人。她因为身体不好，现在一直在一间隐蔽的房间里休养。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"她之前送了我一条项链，但这几天它里面的能量一直都很躁动，保险起见，我和贝娜连夜赶了回来......没想到发生了这么严重的事故。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"原来......","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":221},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":223},{"type":"charslot","id":224},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0.5","fadetime":"0","id":226},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_cg_rainsplash.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":228},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好心的老妇人","text":"那边刚发生了点事，你一个人去不安全。赶紧绕路吧。","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴着帽子的少女","text":"......谢谢提醒。","id":232},{"type":"dialog","id":233},{"type":"image","fadetime":"1","id":234},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_bg_41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","fadetime":"1","id":235},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":236},{"type":"charslot","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我听附近的老奶奶说......","id":238},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_bg_34_g1_victoriavillage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","fadetime":"1","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_243","focus":"m","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"和善的镇民","text":"你快回去吧。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_243.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":244},{"type":"charslot","id":245},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_bg_25_mini02_victoria_street_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","fadetime":"1","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1255_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卖花的妇人","text":"夜黑灯暗，可不要再迷路了。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1255_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":250},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":251},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":252},{"type":"charslot","id":253},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","id":254},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_bg_27_g11_lentinobleroom_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":256},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"祥子小姐，作为梦城堡的主人，我为发生的这一切向你道歉。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"但莫菲丝做了那样过分的事，你也很难原谅她吧......？","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"不......我本来应该对她有所怨恨，但现在心中好像并没有这种情绪。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"......什么？","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d6/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"其实正如她所说，Ave{@nbs}Mujica从来都不是一个紧密相连的团体。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我一开始同意和她打赌，只是想要尽快把乐队成员带回来，谈不上是冷静的判断。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"可当我进入每个成员的梦境，然后被她们一一拒绝时，我才发现自己根本不了解她们的内心。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"在她创造的梦里，我们每个人都只想用看似美好的那面去掩盖内心最脆弱的部分。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"可我有尝试去了解这些曾与我日夜相处的伙伴吗？","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我做好承担他人人生的觉悟了吗？","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"在“无梦之境”的深渊坠落时，我无数次这样质问自己。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"祥子小姐......","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"而当我终于解开心结，将我的伙伴们一个个唤醒，再次站在莫菲丝的面前时，除了最初的愤怒，还有一种莫名的情绪......","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那是一种发自内心的悲伤。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那一刻，我和她四目相对。我突然意识到，我的力量不再单薄，我还有身边的伙伴。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"而她的身边，依然只有她一人，和那些完全遵循她意志的造物。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"她是造梦的人，她比我们任何一人都要清楚，梦境里的一切都是虚假的。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"可她依然选择沉溺在一个又一个的梦境里，一定也有她的难言之隐吧？","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"......","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":297},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"charslot","id":300},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_bg_25_mini02_victoria_street_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":301},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0.5","fadetime":"0","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":303},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，你是没有心的怪物！","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"难怪你爸妈都不要你！","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你活不过这个冬天的！","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"不对，你们胡说！","id":309},{"type":"dialog","id":310},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":311},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"你们快走开！！","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"哦——快跑！","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"莫菲丝，你还好吗？！","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"爱丽丝姐姐，他、他们说的是真的吗？","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"他们是坏孩子对吧？仙女们是不会给他们美梦的，对吧？","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我不是没有心的怪物，不是被父母抛弃的，我能活过这个冬天的，对吧？！","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"莫菲丝......","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"爱丽丝姐姐，回答我！！","id":320},{"type":"dialog","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":323},{"type":"charslot","id":324},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","id":325},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_bg_27_g11_lentinobleroom_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":327},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":328},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"......","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d6/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"出于某些原因，莫菲丝只能在梦城堡生活。","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"这片大地并不像童话一般美好。莫菲丝曾经历的苦难，让她无法相信童话中的那些美梦。","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"而我也深知，梦城堡的美梦并不能解决所有的问题......","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"“和现实比起来，我们的能力实在有限。”","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"“我们能做的，不过是在孩子们内心的最深处，留下一颗种子。”","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"“它可能是年少时，心里觉得最重要的一件事，抑或是一个物品。”","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"“它不会时刻强调自己的存在，但它会在关键的时刻、一个人最脆弱的时刻，给予他力量。”","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"你说的这些......","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d6/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"这些都是梦境里的你对我说的哦，爱丽丝小姐。现在，我把这些也说给你听。","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我想，或许莫菲丝也在等待着某个梦境，让她真正地“长大成人”。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"月亮升起之时，人偶获得生命——你看，月亮不是已经升起来了吗？","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"charslot","id":355},{"type":"text","text":"爱丽丝看向窗外，清冷的月光透过城堡的窗，温柔地洒在了她和祥子的身上。","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"嗯，你说得对。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"另外，爱丽丝小姐，我还有一个请求......","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"请说，我一定尽全力帮你。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"虽然我们五个人都从梦境里苏醒了，但我们好像并没有回到我们原本的那个世界......","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"既然爱丽丝小姐是梦城堡的主人，或许你知道能让我们回去的办法？","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"在你昏迷时，我听过她们描述你所说的那个“世界”。从她们的形容来看，的确不像是泰拉的某个城市。","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d6/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"但你们的情况我的确从来没有遇到过，就算翻遍城堡的资料库也一无所获。","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d6/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"我准备求助一下罗德岛——罗德岛的博士颇有学识，应该能找到将你们送回去的办法。","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d6/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"“罗德岛”......那个医药公司？","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"是的，你在梦里也见过罗德岛吗？","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"嗯，我也想再去那里拜访，还有几个“老朋友”也想见见......欸......？","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"怎么了，祥子小姐？","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我......我有点想不起来她们的模样了。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":383},{"type":"charslot","id":384},{"type":"text","text":"面对正在困惑的祥子，爱丽丝好像早有预料一样，轻轻地捧起了她的手。","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"经历过了这么多人的梦境，祥子小姐，你应该很熟悉梦城堡的规则了。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"正如所有的梦境一样，从醒来的那一刻开始，关于它的记忆就在一点点地模糊消散。","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"终有一天，你会回到属于你的“世界”，到那时，你会忘记我，忘记梦城堡的美梦，忘记泰拉的一切。","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"怎么会这样......！","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"但这里发生的一切并非毫无作用。","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"回去以后，也许你和你的同伴又要重新解决你们的问题......但我相信你们一定会成功。","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"即使你忘记了在这里发生的一切，你也会记得，自己面对困难时的勇气。","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"嗯，我也相信......","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"回到了原来的世界，Ave{@nbs}Mujica也会作为Ave{@nbs}Mujica继续存在着。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"作为梦城堡的主人，我会永远记得你们现在“孩子”的模样。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"可能某一天，我会再次出现在长大的你们面前呢——希望那时，你和你的伙伴仍在用音乐书写你们的人生。","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我们约好了！","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":412},{"type":"charslot","id":413},{"type":"dialog","id":414},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":415},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":416},{"type":"dialog","id":417},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_equipment_collapse","volume":"0.9","id":418},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":419},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"门外是什么声音......","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"不会又有人在捣乱吧？！","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":424},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":425},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":426},{"type":"charslot","id":427},{"type":"image","id":428},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_bg_65_g2_dreamcastlehall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":429},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":430},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":431},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":432},{"type":"text","text":"祥子快步打开了房门。","id":433},{"type":"dialog","id":434},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":435},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#13$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":436},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"小祥——你终于醒了，你还好吗？","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1937_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":439},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_yingying_ked_1","volume":"1","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莽撞的卡尔顿们","text":"（晕乎乎的哼唧声）","id":441,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1937_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"唔，我没事......为什么外面会突然冒出这么大声响？","id":443,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"我们正在布置新的舞台，贝娜小姐就让莫菲丝操控这些小家伙搬东西......","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"新的舞台......？","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"对呀，也不知道我们还要在这待多久，不如趁着空闲时间多排练一下吧。","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"想要练习的曲子还有很多。","id":451,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"本来莫菲丝想直接在梦境里造一个新的舞台，但被我们和贝娜小姐否决了。","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_4186_tmoris_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我这段时间都不想再做梦了......","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"我也一样......","id":457,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你们就没有人关心一下我吗——为什么要我来当苦力啊！！","id":459,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1937_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":460},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_yingying_ked_2","volume":"1","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡尔顿们","text":"（愤怒的哼唧声）","id":462,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_npc_1937_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":463},{"type":"text","text":"站在莫菲丝身旁的贝娜并没有多说什么，只是伸出了手，用力弹了一下莫菲丝毛茸茸的耳朵。","id":464},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"啊——痛痛痛！！","id":466,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1937_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":467},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_yingying_ked_2","volume":"1","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡尔顿们","text":"（惨兮兮的哼唧声）","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1937_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃尔夫","text":"莫菲丝，既然犯错了，就应该接受相应的惩罚......","id":471,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1938_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"沃尔夫，你也别想逃，你去把最后的那盏灯装上去！","id":473,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":474},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃尔夫","text":"我......好的。","id":475,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1938_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":476},{"type":"charslot","id":477},{"type":"text","text":"在众人的面前，沃尔夫双手伏地，很快变成了兽形。","id":478},{"type":"text","text":"它轻松地叼起灯的电线，轻轻一跃，将其稳稳地挂在了顶棚上。","id":479},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"怎么样，新的舞台还满意吗？","id":481,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":482},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"真好看呀——","id":483,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":484},{"type":"charslot","id":485},{"type":"text","text":"若麦飞快地跑上了舞台，在一个个精致的布景间来回穿梭。","id":486},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":487},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"哼，这种事简简单单啦。","id":488,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":489},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"你是不是忘了最重要的乐器？","id":490,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"哎，别弹我耳朵了，我马上拿出来！","id":492,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":493},{"type":"charslot","id":494},{"type":"text","text":"就在莫菲丝捂着耳朵时，台上已经出现了每个人的乐器。大家纷纷走上台。","id":495},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"嗯，还和以前一样顺手。","id":497,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"（希望梦里荒废的那段时间不会影响到现实的肌肉记忆——）","id":499,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"祥子，我们都准备好了，你也来吧。","id":501,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":502},{"type":"charslot","id":503},{"type":"text","text":"祥子抬头看向台上的同伴们，灯光已经汇聚在了她们身上，而熟悉的键盘，也在呼唤着她的回归。","id":504},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":505},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"期待你们的表演，祥子小姐。","id":506,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_338_iris_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":507},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"之前没机会欣赏你们完整的演出，这下可以弥补遗憾啦。","id":508,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1937_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":509},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_yingying_ked_1","volume":"1","id":510},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡尔顿们","text":"（开心的哼唧声）","id":511,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_1937_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":512},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃尔夫","text":"能以非敌人的身份聆听你们的演奏，对我来说是最欣慰的事。","id":513,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_1938_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":514},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你们怎么都在说一些客套话！","id":515,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":516},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"总、总之......我会竖起耳朵听的。","id":517,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":518},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"噗......哈哈哈哈哈哈哈......","id":519,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":520},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你、你笑什么啊！不要以为爱丽丝姐姐和贝娜姐姐在，我就不敢做什么......","id":521,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":522},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"没什么......哈哈，我上台了。","id":523,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":524},{"type":"charslot","id":525},{"type":"text","text":"祥子抓住了队友伸来的手，走上了属于Ave{@nbs}Mujica的舞台。","id":526},{"type":"text","text":"就像拼图拼完了最后一块，也许结果并没有那么令人惊喜，可唯有这一刻，一切才变得完整和圆满。","id":527},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":528},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"各位，在这片大地上，留下属于我们的声音吧！","id":529,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":530},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":531},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":532},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":533},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_65_i13.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":534},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":535},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":536},{"type":"text","text":"月光洒下之时，人偶获得暂时的生命。","id":537},{"type":"text","text":"人偶的皮囊之下，藏着少女们的秘密。","id":538},{"type":"text","text":"爱意，恐惧，悲伤，死亡，遗忘。","id":539},{"type":"text","text":"在梦的城堡中，秘密与罪孽融合复生。","id":540},{"type":"text","text":"高举烛台，踏破荆棘，拨开迷雾。","id":541},{"type":"text","text":"新的童话，就此孕育。","id":542},{"type":"dialog","id":543},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":544},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":545},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"这便是我们这些人偶的奇遇故事。","id":546,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"欢迎来到......Ave{@nbs}Mujica的世界。","id":547,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":548},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":549},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":550},{"type":"charslot","id":551},{"type":"image","id":552}],"characters":["？？？","丰川祥子","三角初华","八幡海铃","祐天寺若麦","若叶睦","卡尔顿们","莫菲丝","沃尔夫","爱丽丝","好心的老妇人","戴着帽子的少女","和善的镇民","卖花的妇人","贝娜","莽撞的卡尔顿们"]}